    "A beloved passage each day, in the translation you read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeden Tag eine beliebte Bibelstelle – in deiner Übersetzung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un pasaje entrañable cada día, en la traducción que lees."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un passage aimé chaque jour, dans votre traduction."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ogni giorno un passo amato, nella traduzione che leggi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎日、心に残る聖句を、あなたの読む翻訳で。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "매일 사랑받는 말씀을, 읽으시는 번역본으로."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uma passagem querida a cada dia, na tradução que você lê."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每天一段珍爱的经文，用你常读的译本呈现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A card holds %lld of these %lld verses, so it shows %@. Select fewer verses, or share the text for the whole passage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf eine Karte passen %1$lld dieser %2$lld Verse, deshalb zeigt sie %3$@. Wähle weniger Verse aus oder teile den Text der ganzen Passage."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A card holds %1$lld of these %2$lld verses, so it shows %3$@. Select fewer verses, or share the text for the whole passage."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una tarjeta admite %1$lld de estos %2$lld versículos, así que muestra %3$@. Selecciona menos versículos o comparte el texto del pasaje completo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une carte contient %1$lld de ces %2$lld versets ; elle affiche donc %3$@. Sélectionnez moins de versets ou partagez le texte du passage entier."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una scheda contiene %1$lld di questi %2$lld versetti, quindi mostra %3$@. Seleziona meno versetti o condividi il testo dell’intero passo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードに収まるのは、この%2$lld節のうち%1$lld節です。そのため%3$@を表示します。選ぶ節を減らすか、箇所全体をテキストで共有してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "카드에는 이 %2$lld개 구절 중 %1$lld개만 들어가므로 %3$@만 표시됩니다. 구절을 더 적게 선택하거나, 본문 전체를 텍스트로 공유하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um cartão comporta %1$lld destes %2$lld versículos, então mostra %3$@. Selecione menos versículos ou compartilhe o texto da passagem inteira."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卡片只能容纳这 %2$lld 节经文中的 %1$lld 节，因此显示 %3$@。请减少所选经文，或分享整段经文的文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few site coordinates in the OpenBible data come from OpenStreetMap. © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License." : {
      "comment" : "Credit for a data source in Sources & Credits",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einige Ortskoordinaten in den OpenBible-Daten stammen von OpenStreetMap. © OpenStreetMap-Mitwirkende, verfügbar unter der Open Database License."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Algunas coordenadas de lugares de los datos de OpenBible proceden de OpenStreetMap. © colaboradores de OpenStreetMap, disponibles bajo la Open Database License."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quelques coordonnées de lieux des données OpenBible proviennent d’OpenStreetMap. © les contributeurs OpenStreetMap, sous licence Open Database License."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alcune coordinate dei luoghi nei dati OpenBible provengono da OpenStreetMap. © contributori di OpenStreetMap, disponibili con licenza Open Database License."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenBible のデータの一部の地点座標は OpenStreetMap によるものです。© OpenStreetMap contributors、Open Database License に基づき利用。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenBible 데이터의 일부 지점 좌표는 OpenStreetMap에서 가져왔습니다. © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License에 따라 제공됩니다."
