    "If you've been reading in Life Bible — the app formerly called Tecarta Bible — your notes, highlights and saved verses can come with you." : {
      "comment" : "“Life Bible” and “Tecarta Bible” are app names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du in Life Bible gelesen hast – der App, die früher Tecarta Bible hieß – können deine Notizen, Markierungen und gespeicherten Verse mitkommen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si has estado leyendo en Life Bible —la app antes llamada Tecarta Bible—, puedes traer contigo tus notas, subrayados y versículos guardados."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si vous lisiez dans Life Bible — l’app autrefois appelée Tecarta Bible — vos notes, surlignages et versets enregistrés peuvent vous suivre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se leggi in Life Bible — l'app prima chiamata Tecarta Bible — puoi portare con te note, evidenziazioni e versetti salvati."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Life Bible（旧称 Tecarta Bible）で読んでいた方は、メモ、ハイライト、保存した聖句をそのまま引き継げます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Life Bible(이전 이름 Tecarta Bible)에서 읽어 오셨다면 노트, 하이라이트, 저장한 구절을 함께 가져올 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
