    "Scripture Alone can’t add to your photo library. Allow it in Settings › Privacy & Security › Photos." : {
      "comment" : "“Settings › Privacy & Security › Photos” should match the system Settings app's menu names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone kann nichts zu deiner Fotomediathek hinzufügen. Erlaube es unter „Einstellungen › Datenschutz & Sicherheit › Fotos“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone no puede añadir nada a tu fototeca. Permíteselo en Ajustes › Privacidad y seguridad › Fotos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone ne peut pas ajouter d’éléments à votre photothèque. Autorisez-le dans Réglages › Confidentialité et sécurité › Photos."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone non può aggiungere elementi alla libreria foto. Consentilo in Impostazioni › Privacy e sicurezza › Foto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone は写真ライブラリに追加できません。「設定」›「プライバシーとセキュリティ」›「写真」で許可してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone이 사진 보관함에 추가할 수 없습니다. 설정 › 개인정보 보호 및 보안 › 사진에서 허용하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Scripture Alone não pode adicionar à sua fototeca. Permita em Ajustes › Privacidade e Segurança › Fotos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone 无法添加到你的照片图库。请在“设置”›“隐私与安全性”›“照片”中允许访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripture Alone is free software under the GNU AGPL. The full list of sources, versions and checksums is in docs/context-sources.md in the source code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone ist freie Software unter der GNU AGPL. Die vollständige Liste der Quellen, Versionen und Prüfsummen findest du im Quellcode unter docs/context-sources.md."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone es software libre bajo la GNU AGPL. La lista completa de fuentes, versiones y sumas de verificación está en docs/context-sources.md, en el código fuente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone est un logiciel libre sous licence GNU AGPL. La liste complète des sources, versions et sommes de contrôle se trouve dans docs/context-sources.md, dans le code source."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone è software libero con licenza GNU AGPL. L’elenco completo di fonti, versioni e checksum è in docs/context-sources.md nel codice sorgente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone は GNU AGPL に基づくフリーソフトウェアです。出典・版・チェックサムの一覧はソースコードの docs/context-sources.md にあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone은 GNU AGPL을 따르는 자유 소프트웨어입니다. 출처, 버전, 체크섬 전체 목록은 소스 코드의 docs/context-sources.md에 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Scripture Alone é software livre sob a GNU AGPL. A lista completa de fontes, versões e somas de verificação está em docs/context-sources.md no código-fonte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone 是遵循 GNU AGPL 的自由软件。完整的来源、版本和校验和列表见源代码中的 docs/context-sources.md。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripture Alone reads slides on your iPhone and never uploads them. Turn on camera access in Settings, or choose a photo you’ve already taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone liest Folien auf deinem iPhone und lädt sie nie hoch. Aktiviere den Kamerazugriff in den Einstellungen oder wähle ein bereits aufgenommenes Foto."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone lee las diapositivas en tu iPhone y nunca las sube. Activa el acceso a la cámara en Ajustes o elige una foto que ya hayas hecho."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone lit les diapositives sur votre iPhone et ne les envoie jamais en ligne. Activez l’accès à l’appareil photo dans Réglages, ou choisissez une photo déjà prise."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone legge le slide sul tuo iPhone e non le carica mai online. Attiva l’accesso alla fotocamera in Impostazioni o scegli una foto già scattata."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone はスライドを iPhone 上で読み取り、アップロードしません。「設定」でカメラアクセスをオンにするか、撮影済みの写真を選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone은 iPhone에서 슬라이드를 읽으며 업로드하지 않습니다. 설정에서 카메라 접근을 켜거나 이미 찍은 사진을 선택하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Scripture Alone lê slides no seu iPhone e nunca os envia. Ative o acesso à câmera nos Ajustes ou escolha uma foto que você já tirou."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scripture Alone 在你的 iPhone 上识别幻灯片，绝不上传。请在“设置”中开启相机访问权限，或选择一张已拍摄的照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
